      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 17,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Even so, Leo is a long-time friend— \r\nHe is a trusted companion.\r\nI truly wish to avoid fighting him.",
