      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 18,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "I understand it will be hard to handle, \r\nbut I must ask for Leo and \r\nthe Vessel of Life—please.",
        "Jp" : "対応に苦労するのは承知で乞うしかないが\r\nレオと命の器を――頼む\r\nこのとおりだ"
